 "title": "Base-change construction for a compactification",
 "statement": "Given a compactification $C=(X\\to\\overline X\\to S)$ and $S'\\to S$, define\n$C_{S'}$ to be\n\n$$\nX\\times_SS'\\longrightarrow\\overline X\\times_SS'\\longrightarrow S'.\n$$",
